~ start
Monster: [center]Did I ever tell you what the true meaning of [nervous]hunger[/nervous] is?[/center]
Monster: [center]It's devouring everything around you...[br]over and over again...[/center]
Monster: [center]...expecting that this time... it will finally [woo]stop[/woo].[/center]
Monster: [center]That. Is. [red_sparkle]Hunger[/red_sparkle].[/center]
Monster: [center]I hope you'll return soon... with something [woo]tasty[/woo] for me.[/center]
Monster: [center][embers]Otherwise... you might find yourself on the menu.[/embers][/center]
=> END

~ open_door
Monster: [center]I've been a bit busy here, making myself at home...[/center]
Monster: [center]I've rearranged your "[glitch]house[/glitch]" a little. It was so... dull before.[/center]
do reveal_door()
Monster: [center]I've opened [glitch]portals[/glitch] to my private domains—parallel worlds where I keep my treats to savor them.[/center]

Monster: [center]Go on, step through.[/center]
Monster: [center]And remember... bring me the most [gold_sparkle]satisfying[/gold_sparkle] thing you can find in this world![/center]


=> END

~ quest_1
Monster: [center]Your tidal pulse... Have you brought what will [nervous]satiate[/nervous] my eternal hunger?[/center]
Monster: [center]No? Then why are you still here, little slave? Do you want to become part of my eternity right now?[/center]
Monster: [center]I need to [nervous]consume[/nervous], and soon... or my stomach will cry out with your voice.[/center]
=> END

~ quest_2
Monster: [center]Ooooh... what divine [nervous]fulfillment[/nervous]...[/center]
Monster: [center]The sweet taste of patience with a bitter aftertaste of toxic friendship. You've exceeded expectations, my slave.[/center]
Monster: [center][i]*A terrifying groan of a hungry womb*[/i][/center]
Monster: [center]Ahhh... but my hunger is only just gathering speed! It devours me from within![/center]
Monster: [center]Quickly... bring me something [nervous]enormous[/nervous].[/center]
Monster: [center]Something so colossal it can fill my void and tame this thirst to [nervous]consume[/nervous]![/center]
do ProgressionManager.set_flag("planet_quest", true)
=> END

~ quest_3
Monster: [center]Your delay smells of fear... and it's very [nervous]appetizing[/nervous].[/center]
Monster: [center]Where is my offering? Bring me something [nervous]enormous[/nervous], or I'll stop waiting and simply [nervous]consume[/nervous] you![/center]
Monster: [center]My stomach doesn't care who becomes the next victim![/center]
=> END

~ quest_4
Monster: [center]This hunger... it's [glitch]driving me mad[/glitch]! I can feel its presence...[/center]
Monster: [center]Did you bring it? What are you waiting for, little slave? [nervous]GIVE IT HERE![/nervous][/center]
Monster: [center]My patience is wearing thinner than your hope for salvation![/center]
=> END

~ end_game
Monster: [center]Ooooh... Yes... What bliss...[/center]
Monster: [center]This is truly the most [nervous]enormous[/nervous] and beautiful thing I've eaten in all the infinity of my existence.[/center]
Monster: [center]This taste... it's infinite, like the ego that gave birth to it. Every atom of matter is filled with [gold_sparkle]triumph[/gold_sparkle].[/center]
Monster: [center][i]*A heavy, satisfied sigh, turning into a sleepy snore*[/i][/center]
Monster: [center]Ahhh... greatness makes me sleepy... Don't disturb... Let me... [woo]sleep[/woo].[/center]
Monster: [center]But don't go far, my little slave. Soon I'll wake up... and I'll want some breakfast...[/center]
do ScreenTransition.transition_to_scene("uid://d7n7fj2vp3kd")
=> END
